      "evidence": "2026-06-18: unit-proven across three suites (146/146 pass, tsc clean on touched files). projectDiff.test.ts: an under-specified connection passes validateConnections([]) and completeConnectionsInDiff fills all five zome Connection fields well-typed; distinct randomizer per connection; idempotent. acornTools.test.ts: propose_edits with a connection carrying only {parent,child,siblingOrder} opens a draft whose connection has randomizer:number + isImported:false. applyProjectDiff.test.ts: at the apply boundary an under-specified connection reaches the (mock) zome with randomizer/isImported defaulted.",
