      "by": "uhCAk6NMsJYZovJRS4CRK3hQsv5bN5pWENojRKPEA3x8grOccqulR",
      "at": 1782963119145
    },
    {
      "statement": "The default-target computation (edited ids -> tree LCA with anchor folded in, root-guarded; no-edits -> first-turn ask-time selection; root-LCA -> prompt) is pure and unit-tested",
      "evaluator": "executable",
      "met": true,
      "by": "uhCAk6NMsJYZovJRS4CRK3hQsv5bN5pWENojRKPEA3x8grOccqulR",
      "at": 1782873600000,
      "evidence": "2026-06-30: web/test/conversationAttach.test.ts — 14 tests pass (added: an ancestor anchor raises the target up to the open branch; an unrelated anchor never drags a well-scoped edit set to the root). Covers the LCA matrix, anchor fold + root-guard, single-edit, root-only, no-edits anchor, none, and unknown-id filtering. Suite green (52/52 across conversation+transcript+chatHistory); tsc clean on touched files."
    }
  ],
